---
code: records-header-missing
when-fires: framed records material arrived before any header line, or the stream ended without one. plan/records.rs admit_records (the strict admission path); the forgiving deframer emits it too. Static.
why: 262 §1/§2: a missing header refuses the read unit (kFAIL-perform).
---
-- book.sh --
#!/bin/sh
hork tune --profile web

-- controller-results.txt --
dorc site 0 effect=holds rc=0 @@dorc@@
dorc-records-end/1 nonce=dorc @@dorc@@

-- replay --
$ dorc plan --book=book.sh --results - < controller-results.txt > /dev/null
records: warning[records-header-missing]: sm a framed records stream carried no
`dorc-records/1` header (torn/absent) -- the read unit is refused, the host runs
(kFAIL-perform)
